  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1253059.svg\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"></p><div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&amp;link=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&amp;link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-yellow?style=plastic&amp;link=https://fabricmc.net/\" alt=\"靜態徽章\"></div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組允許在 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful</a> 中使用任何 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/numismatic-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Numismatic Overhaul</a> 的貨幣。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Numismatic Bounties/screen/base.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1037\" height=\"488\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，此專案仍完全兼容 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-bounties\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Bounties</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Numismatic Bounties/screen/extra.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\" width=\"1034\" height=\"488\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
